{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018W3sh1T7RUmmkR59xekqPX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: GNU coreutils have no formal specifications accessible to implementers. go-unix-utils derives formal specs from C source, generates Go implementations via AI (mage-claude-orchestrator), and verifies parity against Homebrew reference binaries through differential testing.\n\n**Architecture**: Four-stage pipeline (extract → specify → synthesize → verify). Human operator writes SRDs and use cases; orchestrator generates Go code in `cmd/` and `pkg/`; `pkg/testutils` runs differential tests comparing Go binaries against `g`-prefixed GNU reference binaries.\n\n**Current state**: 114 SRDs specified, 111 utilities. Many releases partially implemented. Recent commits completed csplit R2.1-R2.4 and R3.1-R3.4, leaving R4.1-R4.4 as the final csplit group.\n\n**Current release focus**: Release 08.1 (file splitting, joining, formatting, data display). Remaining ready requirements: srd068-csplit R4, srd069-join R1-R4, srd070-fmt, srd071-numfmt, srd072-od, srd073-printf.\n\n## Priority Reasoning\n\nRelease 08.1 is the earliest release with ready requirements. Within 08.1:\n1. **srd068-csplit R4.1-R4.4** — finishes an in-progress utility (R1-R3 done)\n2. **srd069-join R1.1-R4.4** — next unstarted utility (alphabetically after csplit)\n\nDependencies: csplit R4 impl → csplit R4 tests; join contract → join R1 impl. Both chains are independent.\n\n## Weight Budget Checks\n\n```\nTask 0: srd068 R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) + R4.3(w=1) + R4.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\nTask 1: srd068 R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) + R4.3(w=1) + R4.4(w=1) = 4 ✓ (test task, same R-items)\nTask 2: Contract task, no SRD R-items, N/A\nTask 3: srd069 R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) + R1.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\n```\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/csplit: srd068 R4.1-R4.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd068-csplit.yaml (requirements R4.1 through R4.4)\n      - cmd/csplit/main.go (existing implementation covering R1 through R3)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/csplit/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Implement R4.1-R4.4 requirements\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd068-csplit requirement R4.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd068-csplit requirement R4.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd068-csplit requirement R4.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd068-csplit requirement R4.4 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Follow the existing code structure and patterns in cmd/csplit/main.go from R1-R3 implementation\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main() per shared protocol\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"All new code integrates with the existing flag parsing and dispatch logic\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"srd068-csplit R4.1 implemented in cmd/csplit/main.go\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"srd068-csplit R4.2 implemented in cmd/csplit/main.go\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"srd068-csplit R4.3 implemented in cmd/csplit/main.go\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"srd068-csplit R4.4 implemented in cmd/csplit/main.go\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"go build ./cmd/csplit/ succeeds with no errors\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/csplit/ reports no issues\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/csplit: srd068 R4.1-R4.4 (tests)\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd068-csplit.yaml (requirements R4.1 through R4.4)\n      - cmd/csplit/main.go (implementation of R4.1-R4.4 from prior task)\n      - cmd